{"symbol":"VVIPIL","yahoo":"VVIPIL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"VVIP Infratech Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://vvipinfra.com","about":"VVIP Infratech Limited operates as a civil and electrical contractor for the execution and construction of infrastructure projects in India. The company constructs various infrastructure projects, such as sewers and sewer treatment plants; water tanks and water treatment plants; road sector and electrification development; transmission and distribution infrastructure; and civil construction work, including buildings, roads, drainage systems, and foundations. It also engages in the planning, execution, and maintenance of water pipelines, treatment plants, reservoirs, and pumping stations; planning, design, execution, and operation of wastewater treatment systems; laying of underground sewerage networks; installation of pumping stations; and integration of automation systems. In addition, the company is involved in residential and commercial real estate development activities. VVIP Infratech Limited was incorporated in 2001 and is based in Ghaziabad, India.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:23:45+00:00","quote":{"price":142.9,"prevClose":144.0,"marketCap":356.82,"high52":165.95,"low52":92.05,"pe":11.87,"bookValue":91.7,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":17.84,"shares":2.497,"insiders":76.7,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06","2024-08-07","2024-08-08","2024-08-09","2024-08-12","2024-08-13","2024-08-14","2024-08-16","2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024-08-28","2024-08-29","2024-08-30","2024-09-02","2024-09-03","2024-09-04","2024-09-05","2024-09-06","2024-09-09","2024-09-10","2024-09-11","2024-09-12","2024-09-13","2024-09-16","2024-09-17","2024-09-18","2024-09-19","2024-09-20","2024-09-23","2024-09-24","2024-09-25","2024-09-26","2024-09-27","2